Package: vabaxos-agenda
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-ecal-2.0, gir1.2-edataserver-1.2, evolution-data-server, vabaxos-reminders
Recommends: gnome-online-accounts, gnome-control-center, gnome-calendar
Description: The agenda, said as sentences
 The appointments of every calendar of GNOME (the computer's own, and
 Google or Microsoft 365 / Outlook added in GNOME's Online Accounts), day
 by day, each said as a sentence: "Tomorrow at 10:30, Dentist, one hour,
 Via Roma 3". New appointments written as they are said, read back
 before saving. Super+Alt+A says today's and tomorrow's appointments; the
 reminders say each appointment 15 minutes before.
